      "text": {
        "jp": "名前を覚えてくれてたなんて嬉しいねえ。\r\nこりゃ、脈ありってことで間違いないかな。",
        "official_en": "So you remembered my name! Ahhh, I see what’s going on...someone’s got a crush on me!",
        "real_en": "You remembered my name! I'm delighted. Does that mean I've got a chance with you?"
